T4 - Staking (ECONOMICS_PLAN). Gate literally: 1000 delegators (1000-1999 ALCRY) with shares summing to exactly one pool at every one of the 2004 scenario steps (share-based delegations, rewards compound into the pool); NC literally: withdrawal without unbonding -> red (NoUnbonding/StillUnbonding). Min stake 1000 ALCRY; commission 1000 bps from rewards only (D-T2); unbonding 21 days = 362 880 blocks at 5 s (boundary 362879 red / 362880 green); slashing period = the unbonding window, slashes cut bonded and unbonding stake proportionally. Golden digest e80662c82c74e1d1a0a5b0624beb4cf08af88c24f8091751c277cc7ea6887f07 pinned in Rust tests and re-derived by the independent Python oracle (full model re-implementation), which cross-runs t4_staking_example. Exact 256-bit mul_div for proportional math. NC: 7/7 named messages (tools/nc_t4.py; standard 6 + slash proportionality, H6-H9 precedent). 10 gate tests + 2 metamorphisms. Evidence docs/evidence/t4 (543 NCs cumulative over 81 phases). Stage 1 (T0-T4) of ECONOMICS_PLAN complete. ALL GATES GREEN.
